  "description": "A Roman timber amphitheater dating from the first to fifth centuries, the K\u00fcnzing Roman amphitheater measured 46 by 40 meters. The site was discovered during excavations carried out in 2003 and 2004. The archaeological site is no longer visible but a reconstructed evocation of the ancient structure marks the location.",
